{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "a-note-from-hysilens",
  "name": "A Note from Hysilens",
  "sortId": 129988,
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Note_from_Hysilens",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-30T12:21:08.250Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To my dear Little Gray Fry,"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-68a435eb8b18bb72"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've known all along that you, having swum from beyond the sky, were destined to return to even vaster waters."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I can see the roiling tides within your eyes, the gaze of a fish that longs for nothing but freedom."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-897f58ae034c6c0a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As for this other little blind fish... I cannot bear to leave the mirage before my eyes, attached as I am to this pool in the cave."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To me, that brilliant sea of stars is far too dazzling."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Besides, here in this little pool, I have a sun to call my own."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-64376610158eb63f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So, before that spark sets your sky ablaze,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "accept this gift, and let the memories it whispers be my companion at your side."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Within this shell fossil dwells the song of the tides."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I would occasionally press it to my cheek, listening for the sound of home."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0164474c21affb46"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In your travels across the vast expanse of the cosmos, if this shell helps you recall the humble pool you left behind,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "the taste of the honey brew, and the banquet we never finished..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That would be the best one could hope for, wouldn't it?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-93864be662ad776f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "♫ May your trailblazing never cease, until you reach the starry shores ♫"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "♫ May your path be one of perfect ease, as the cosmic ocean roars ♫"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-81101a02518f24d1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Helektra"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b2adf0d648e788af"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
